{
  "id": "509",
  "title": "Changed Travel Plans",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-05-16",
  "synopsis": "Ms. Honda calls Little He to inform that her travel plans have changed.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/735/00649a701e9856702fdc6e5e972291d36999f248.mp3?1698351276",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我的行程有些变化\n\n本田：喂，您是何先生吗？我是本田。\n小何：本田女士，您好！怎么？您已经到北京了？\n本田：没有，我还在日本。我是想告诉您，我的行程有些变化。我要先去越南办点事，然后从广州转机去北京。这样，我要15号才能到北京。\n小何：没问题。那我把谈判安排到16号。\n本田：好的。因为我15号晚上很晚才能到北京，所以如果方便，我希望谈判能安排在16号中午以后进行。\n小何：好的。没问题。\n本田：谢谢您了！那我们到时见！\n小何：恭候您的光临！",
    "traditional": "我的行程有些變化\n\n本田：喂，您是何先生嗎？我是本田。\n小何：本田女士，您好！怎麼？您已經到北京了？\n本田：沒有，我還在日本。我是想告訴您，我的行程有些變化。我要先去越南辦點事，然後從廣州轉機去北京。這樣，我要15號才能到北京。\n小何：沒問題。那我把談判安排到16號。\n本田：好的。因為我15號晚上很晚才能到北京，所以如果方便，我希望談判能安排在16號中午以後進行。\n小何：好的。沒問題。\n本田：謝謝您了！那我們到時見！\n小何：恭候您的光臨！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My Travel Plans Have Changed"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本田：喂，您是何先生吗？我是本田。",
      "traditional": "本田：喂，您是何先生嗎？我是本田。",
      "pinyin": "běn tián wéi nín shì hé xiān sheng ma wǒ shì běn tián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honda: Hello, is this Mr. He? I'm Honda."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：本田女士，您好！怎么？您已经到北京了？",
      "traditional": "小何：本田女士，您好！怎麼？您已經到北京了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé běn tián nǚ shì nín hǎo zěn me nín yǐ jīng dào běi jīng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Hello, Ms. Honda! What happened? Have you already arrived in Beijing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本田：没有，我还在日本。我是想告诉您，我的行程有些变化。",
      "traditional": "本田：沒有，我還在日本。我是想告訴您，我的行程有些變化。",
      "pinyin": "běn tián méi yǒu wǒ hái zài rì běn wǒ shì xiǎng gào su nín wǒ de xíng chéng yǒu xiē biàn huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我要先去越南办点事，然后从广州转机去北京。",
      "traditional": "我要先去越南辦點事，然後從廣州轉機去北京。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yào xiān qù yuè nán bàn diǎn shì rán hòu cóng guǎng zhōu zhuǎn jī qù běi jīng",
      "english": "Honda: No, I'm still in Japan. I want to tell you that my travel plans have changed a bit."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "这样，我要15号才能到北京。",
      "traditional": "這樣，我要15號才能到北京。",
      "pinyin": "zhè yàng wǒ yào 2 hào cái néng dào běi jīng",
      "english": "I will first go to Vietnam for some work, and then change flights in Guangzhou to go to Beijing."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This way I won't reach Beijing until the 15th."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小何：没问题。那我把谈判安排到16号。",
      "traditional": "小何：沒問題。那我把談判安排到16號。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé méi wèn tí nà wǒ bǎ tán pàn ān pái dào 2 hào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: No problem. I will arrange for the negotiations to take place on the 16th."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本田：好的。",
      "traditional": "本田：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn tián hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "因为我15号晚上很晚才能到北京，所以如果方便，我希望谈判能安排在16号中午以后进行。",
      "traditional": "因為我15號晚上很晚才能到北京，所以如果方便，我希望談判能安排在16號中午以後進行。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi wǒ 2 hào wǎn shang hěn wǎn cái néng dào běi jīng suǒ yǐ rú guǒ fāng biàn wǒ xī wàng tán pàn néng ān pái zài 2 hào zhōng wǔ yǐ hòu jìn xíng",
      "english": "Honda: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I will arrive late in the evening on the 15th, so if possible I would like the talks to be after lunch on the 16th."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小何：好的。没问题。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的。沒問題。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de méi wèn tí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Sure, no problem."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "本田：谢谢您了！那我们到时见！",
      "traditional": "本田：謝謝您了！那我們到時見！",
      "pinyin": "běn tián xiè xie nín le nà wǒ men dào shí jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honda: Thank you! See you then!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "小何：恭候您的光临！",
      "traditional": "小何：恭候您的光臨！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé gōng hòu nín de guāng lín",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: We're looking forward to your arrival!"
    }
  ],
