    "sentence_translations": [
      "My Travel Plans Have Changed",
      "",
      "Honda: Hello, is this Mr. He? I'm Honda.",
      "",
      "Little He: Hello, Ms. Honda! What happened? Have you already arrived in Beijing?",
      "",
      "Honda: No, I'm still in Japan. I want to tell you that my travel plans have changed a bit.",
      "I will first go to Vietnam for some work, and then change flights in Guangzhou to go to Beijing.",
      "This way I won't reach Beijing until the 15th.",
      "",
      "Little He: No problem. I will arrange for the negotiations to take place on the 16th.",
      "",
      "Honda: Ok.",
      "I will arrive late in the evening on the 15th, so if possible I would like the talks to be after lunch on the 16th.",
      "",
      "Little He: Sure, no problem.",
      "",
      "Honda: Thank you! See you then!",
      "",
      "Little He: We're looking forward to your arrival!",
      ""
    ]
